bisïnöcunapis asipäman.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Lädöcho caycajcunapis jamurpäman.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"Tayta Dios, ¿imay-yajraj rabyashalla caycanqui?","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"¿Imayraj rabyashayqui päsacanga?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Rabyasha carga castigay mana rispitashojcunata,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mana rejsishojcunata, mana mañacamushojcunata.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Paycunami Jacobpita mirar aywajcunata wañuchisha.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Cay nasyuntapis cachaycusha ragällanta.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Unay caj awilöcunapa juchanpitaga ama nogacunata castigamaychu.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Fiyupami llaquisha caycäcuna.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Cuyacoj cashpayqui juclla yanapaycamay.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"Nogacunata salbamaj Tayta Dios, yanapaycamay.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Juchäcunapita perdunaycamay salbaycamay alli cashayquimanno.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Mana yanapämaptiqui mana rispitashojcunaga","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"«¿Maychötaj Diosniqui caycan?» nimangami.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Gamta sirbishoj uywayniquicunata wañuchishanpita","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ayñita cutichishayquitami ricayta munä.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Mana sirbishojcunapis musyachun gam castigashayquita.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Prësucuna mañacushushayquitapis wiyaycuy ari.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Wañuchicänanpaj caycajcunatapis munayniquiwan salbaycuy ari.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"Tayta Dios, ganchis cuti maspa castigay bisïnöcuna","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"gampa contrayqui rimashanpita.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Acrashayqui runacunaga uyshayquicunanömi.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Imaypis agradësicuycäshayquimi.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Imaycamapis mana cachaycuypami gamta alabar alabansacunata cantaycäshaj.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/qub_wbt/PSA/79.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/qub_wbt/PSA/80.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/qub_wbt/PSA/78.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}